  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">25F-Swisscontact - Climate-Smart Fruit Value Chains for Resilient and Inclusive Growth in Ghana</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the project is to enhance climate resilience and inclusive economic growth in Ghana&#x2019;s mango, pineapple, and coconut value chains by introducing regenerative agriculture practices, improved planting materials, biochar, and solar irrigation. It targets smallholder farmers, especially women and youth, aiming to increase productivity, restore soil health, reduce climate vulnerability, and create decent rural employment. The project aligns with Ghana&#x2019;s national goals for agricultural transformation, climate change adaptation, and local value addition, contributing to food security, export diversification, and gender-inclusive development.</narrative>
  </description>
